### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### list_repos — account default (via GITHUB_TOKEN env)
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
X-API-Key: changeme
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "list_repos",
    "arguments": {
      "account": "default",
      "type": "owner",
      "page": 1
    }
  }
}

### list_repos — solo repo pubblici
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
X-API-Key: changeme
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "list_repos",
    "arguments": {
      "account": "default",
      "type": "public"
    }
  }
}

